From 426576f9abf95fd4c445d7d76e9f60c67976e3b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mik <mik@devnesthub.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 12:23:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Rebrand to AIWiredOfficial, point CTAs at new channel,
 build full admin CRUD panel

Rebrand:
- Site name changed from ZeroTokensAI to AIWiredOfficial everywhere (header, page titles, WebSite JSON-LD)
- 'Subscribe' / 'Watch on YouTube' CTAs now default to https://www.youtube.com/@AIWiredOfficial159 (still overridable via NEXT_PUBLIC_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_URL)

Admin panel (previously an unauthenticated single 'add video' form):
- Added password-based auth: /admin/login, signed + expiring session cookie (lib/auth.ts), gated by an ADMIN_PASSWORD env var
- All /admin routes and all mutating server actions now check auth before doing anything
- Add/re-sync a video (existing functionality, now auth-gated)
- Edit a video: title, slug, thumbnail, description (app/admin/[id]/edit) with slug-collision checking
- Delete a video, with confirmation (transcript cascades automatically per the existing schema)
- Search/filter box across the video list
- Logout button

Infra cleanup:
- Added lib/prisma.ts as a single shared Prisma singleton; every page and server action now imports it instead of constructing its own PrismaClient/PrismaPg (reduces risk of exhausting the Postgres connection pool in serverless)
- Added .env.example documenting all required env vars, including the new ADMIN_PASSWORD
